# Golden dumps are regenerated by toolkit/capture_baseline.py. The mel-band one
# is committed because it is 36 MB; the 4-stem one is 134 MB (T=1101 x 4 stems)
# and its checkpoint is not redistributable anyway, so anyone who can capture it
# already has the .ckpt.
